From d1795dc3eefc54c3a967d0b3b0a8aa2c2ff7080e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Konrad Schwarz <konrad.schwarz@siemens.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 17:36:40 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Ada: Remove FDL Front-Cover Text from GNAT RM and UG

This patch removes the Front-Cover Text definitions from the two GNAT
manuals.  This eliminates the obligation on publishers to print the
titles of the manuals on their covers and allows Debian to continue
with its current packaging.

gcc/ada/
	PR ada/128510
	* doc/gnat_rm.rst: Remove FDL Front-Cover Text.
	* doc/gnat_ugn.rst: Likewise.
	* gnat_rm.texi: Regenerate.
	* gnat_ugn.texi: Likewise.
---
 gcc/ada/doc/gnat_rm.rst  | 6 +++---
 gcc/ada/doc/gnat_ugn.rst | 7 +++----
 gcc/ada/gnat_rm.texi     | 6 +++---
 gcc/ada/gnat_ugn.texi    | 7 +++----
 4 files changed, 12 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)

diff --git a/gcc/ada/doc/gnat_rm.rst b/gcc/ada/doc/gnat_rm.rst
index 27551caf36a4..30da4f5e9498 100644
--- a/gcc/ada/doc/gnat_rm.rst
+++ b/gcc/ada/doc/gnat_rm.rst
@@ -31,9 +31,9 @@ GNAT Reference Manual
     Permission is granted to copy, distribute and/or modify this document
     under the terms of the GNU Free Documentation License, Version 1.3 or
     any later version published by the Free Software Foundation; with no
-    Invariant Sections, with the Front-Cover Texts being "GNAT Reference
-    Manual", and with no Back-Cover Texts.  A copy of the license is
-    included in the section entitled :ref:`gnu_fdl`.
+    Invariant Sections, with no Front-Cover Texts, and with no Back-Cover
+    Texts.  A copy of the license is included in the section entitled
+    :ref:`gnu_fdl`.
 
 .. toctree::
    :numbered:
